{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18121","headline":"和李相公摄事南郊览物兴怀呈一二知旧 · 韩愈","name":"和李相公摄事南郊览物兴怀呈一二知旧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灿灿辰角曙，亭亭寒露朝。\n川原共澄暎，云日还浮飘。\n上宰严祀事，清途振华镳。\n圆丘峻且坦，前对南山标。\n村树黄复绿，中田稼何饶。\n顾瞻想岩谷，兴叹倦尘嚣。\n惟彼颠瞑者，去公岂不辽。\n爲仁朝自治，用静兵以销。\n勿惮吐捉勤，可歌风雨调。\n圣贤相遇少，功德今宣昭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}